### 1.3 — Language & Framework Detection

```
LANGUAGE DETECTION:
  - Primary language: file extension frequency + config file type
  - Secondary languages: scripting, IaC, config DSLs

FRAMEWORK DETECTION (match against well-known indicators):

  JVM / Spring:
    build.gradle or pom.xml contains: spring-boot, spring-web, spring-data,
    spring-kafka, spring-batch, spring-cloud, spring-security

  Python:
    requirements.txt or pyproject.toml contains: fastapi, flask, django,
    celery, sqlalchemy, pydantic, airflow, prefect, luigi

  Node / JS / TS:
    package.json dependencies contain: express, nest, next, react, vue,
    angular, fastify, hapi, bull, kafkajs

  Go:
    go.mod contains: gin, echo, fiber, chi, grpc, sarama

  .NET:
    *.csproj contains: Microsoft.AspNetCore, Entity Framework, MassTransit

  General cross-language:
    - Message broker: kafka, rabbitmq, sqs, pubsub, nats, activemq
    - Database ORM: hibernate, sequelize, sqlalchemy, gorm, prisma
    - Cache: redis, memcached, hazelcast
    - gRPC: .proto files present
    - GraphQL: .graphql / schema.graphql present
    - OpenAPI: openapi.yaml / swagger.yaml present
```

